@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Digidoclocker)

[*] --> INITIAL_STATE
INITIAL_STATE --> MemberRegistration : ENTER_MEMBER_DETAILS
MemberRegistration --> CheckMemberDetails : VALID_DETAILS
  CheckMemberDetails --> IssueMemberID : SUCCESS
    IssueMemberID --> Authentication : ISSUE_MEMBER_ID
Authentication --> EnterMemberID : ENTER_MEMBER_ID
EnterMemberID --> EnterPassword : ENTERED
  EnterPassword --> SuccessfulLogin : VALID_CREDENTIALS
    SuccessfulLogin --> LoggedIn : SUCCESSFUL_LOGIN
LoggedIn --> Dashboard : OPEN_DASHBOARD
Dashboard --> Settings : OPEN_SETTINGS
Settings --> Dashboard : BACK
CitizenUploadDocs --> CitizenViewDocs : UPLOAD_DOCS
CitizenViewDocs --> CitizenEditDocs : VIEW_DOCS
CitizenEditDocs --> CitizenSaveEdits : SAVE_EDITS
CitizenSaveEdits --> CitizenViewDocs : SUCCESS
CitizenLogout --> [*] : LOGOUT
@enduml
